 ╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
 │                                                                            │
 │  What you can do                                                           │
 │                                                                            │
 │  Sessions   n / N                                                          │
 │             new session (Enter creates) / quick create. This list is all   │
 │             of them.                                                       │
 │  Switch     Enter / Ctrl+Q / `                                             │
 │             open the selected session / back to this list / the previous   │
 │             one.                                                           │
 │  Send       o / Q                                                          │
 │             message a session without opening it / queue one for after     │
 │             its turn.                                                      │
 │  Conductor  agent-deck conductor setup <name>                              │
 │             one agent that watches the others and asks you only when       │
 │             needed.                                                        │
 │  Remotes    agent-deck remote add <name> user@host                         │
 │             plug in any machine; its sessions show up here.                │
 │                                                                            │
 │  ? all keys · alt+w shows this again · Z reports a problem.                │
 │                                                                            │
 │  Tab agents & sign-in · Esc close                                          │
 │                                                                            │
 ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯